# Boy and the Beast (crystalWar 24) beside Perils of the Griffon (a Lua quest) and In a Haze of Glory (a Lua quest,
# available once Perils is completed; its Rholont reply is the Event 637 in every state): a level 99 Warrior in
# Southern San d'Oria [S] with Perils, Claws of the Griffon and the WotG mission Back to the Beginning completed
# (GMs; missions as the main flow). Rholont at Prog 1: 56 (Progress) beats 637 every time (twice); Prog 2: 57 (Event)
# ties 637 and they rotate (57, then 637). Prog 3: not 57: 637. Vunkerl Inlet [S], Prog 3 and the quest available (a
# GM): qm7 answers nothing. Accepted by a GM at Prog 2 with no herb, 16:00 sharp (4 hours on from the harness's 12:00):
# Leafy Patch 107 (2), finished: the herb; qm7 109 takes it; 08:00 sharp the next day: 107 (1).
lists SouthernSanDoriaS/Rholont/onTrigger SouthernSanDoriaS/onEventFinish/56 VunkerlInletS/qm7/onTrigger VunkerlInletS/Leafy_Patch/onTrigger VunkerlInletS/onEventFinish/107 VunkerlInletS/onEventFinish/109
char zone=SouthernSanDoriaS pos=-167.043,-2,55.484 job=WAR lvl=99
quest CrystalWar.PerilsOfTheGriffon completed # In a Haze of Glory available: Rholont 637 (an Event)
quest CrystalWar.ClawsOfTheGriffon completed
mission Wotg BackToTheBeginning completed
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
login
charvar Quest[7][24]Prog 1              # a GM
trigger Rholont                         # Prog 1: 56 over 637
finish                                  # Prog 2
charvar Quest[7][24]Prog 1              # a GM
trigger Rholont                         # the same state again: 56
finish
trigger Rholont                         # Prog 2: 57 (an Event), first in order
finish-if-event
trigger Rholont                         # the same state again: 637
finish-if-event
charvar Quest[7][24]Prog 3              # a GM
trigger Rholont                         # Prog 3: no quest reply: 637
finish-if-event
warp -24.775,-32.004,366.937 VunkerlInletS
trigger qm7                             # available, Prog 3: nothing
finish-if-event
quest CrystalWar.BoyAndTheBeast accepted # a GM: no herb, no memo
charvar Quest[7][24]Prog 2              # a GM
wait vana=4                             # 16:00 (12:00 at the harness's start)
walk -425.564,-31.019,581.825
trigger Leafy_Patch                     # no herb, 16:00 sharp: 107 (2)
finish option=0                         # the herb
walk -24.775,-32.004,366.937
trigger qm7                             # the herb, Prog 2: 109
finish                                  # the herb taken
wait vana=16                            # 08:00 the next day
walk -425.564,-31.019,581.825
trigger Leafy_Patch                     # no herb, 08:00 sharp: 107 (1)
finish option=0
